            <ArticleTitle>Tumor-to-tumor metastasis of breast carcinoma to cervical spinal schwannoma: Case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>435-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/02688697.2014.997666</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Tumor-to-tumor metastasis with schwannoma as a recipient tumor is very rare. There have been no reports on tumor to spinal schwannoma metastasis. We report a case of a 57-year-old woman who presented with neck pain and who turned out to have cervical spinal nerve schwannoma with breast carcinoma metastasis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
